WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.120
Looking for work?&nbsp;

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.320
This is how to score a job&nbsp;
interview at the SCP Foundation!&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.920
Enjoy dealing with interesting people on&nbsp;
the job? Do you love the idea of every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.400
day at work possibly being your last? If&nbsp;
so, then we may have a position for you!

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.280
Wanna be a researcher?
]Pick an esoteric scientific field&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.720
and then rise to the top of it, before&nbsp;
developing an obsession with studying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.760
the supernatural. You’ll get laughed out of&nbsp;
academia, and right into an SCP Containment Site!

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.600
Wanna be a guard or an MTF Member?
Become a stone-cold military badass,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.080
get the rest of your team&nbsp;
tragically killed by an anomaly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.000
and start seeking revenge until the&nbsp;
Foundation decides to let you go pro!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.040
Wanna be a member of the O5 Council?
See to it that one of the current&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.480
members “disappears”, that seems&nbsp;
to work like a charm! Good Luck!

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.800
Wanna be a D-Class?
Oh, that’s easy - Just commit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.840
a series of pretty horrific murders,&nbsp;
seek the death penalty at your trial,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.760
and say “Yes” if any mysterious men&nbsp;
in white coats offer you a way out.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.960
Note: SCP Explained absolutely DOES NOT endorse&nbsp;
committing a series of pretty horrific murders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.200
or any kind of murders whatsoever.&nbsp;
We’re just talking jokes here, folks,&nbsp;

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.720
and if you say otherwise we’ll deny it in court.

